---
const shared = [
  "中位数缺失防护",
  "未知类别处理",
  "零方差检查",
  "analysis fold 内上采样至 1:1",
];
const paths = [
  {
    name: "rec_lr",
    models: "Logistic Regression · XGBoost",
    extra: "Dummy 编码",
    reason: "两个引擎接收数值矩阵；计划和二元字段转换为指示列。",
  },
  {
    name: "rec_rf",
    models: "Random Forest · LightGBM · Naive Bayes",
    extra: "保留 factor",
    reason: "相应引擎直接处理分类水平；不额外展开指示列。",
  },
] as const;
---

<figure
  class="recipe-comparison"
  data-recipe-comparison
  data-recipe-paths={JSON.stringify(paths)}
>
  <figcaption>
    <span>RECIPE / 01</span><div>
      <h3>相同的验证边界，不代表所有模型使用相同输入</h3><p>
        选择一条路径，查看共同步骤如何与模型特定的输入处理组合。
      </p>
    </div>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="recipe-comparison__switch" role="tablist" aria-label="预处理路径">
    {
      paths.map((path, index) => (
        <button
          role="tab"
          type="button"
          aria-selected={index === 0 ? "true" : "false"}
          data-recipe-tab={index}
        >
          {path.name}
        </button>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <div class="recipe-comparison__path" role="tabpanel">
    <div class="recipe-comparison__models">
      <strong data-recipe-name>{paths[0].name}</strong><span data-recipe-models
        >{paths[0].models}</span
      >
    </div>
    <ol>
      {shared.map((step) => <li>{step}</li>)}<li class="is-extra" data-recipe-extra>
        {paths[0].extra}
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p data-recipe-reason>{paths[0].reason}</p>
  </div>
  <p class="recipe-comparison__reading">
    上采样发生在每个 analysis fold 内；assessment fold 与 39,200 条留出记录维持约 69/31
    的自然类别比例。这样比较的分数不会因验证集被重复记录改变而失真。
  </p>
</figure>

<script>
  const initialize = () => {
    const root = document.querySelector("[data-recipe-comparison]");
    if (!(root instanceof HTMLElement) || root.dataset.ready === "true") return;
    root.dataset.ready = "true";
    const recipePaths = JSON.parse(root.dataset.recipePaths || "[]");
    const name = root.querySelector("[data-recipe-name]"),
      models = root.querySelector("[data-recipe-models]"),
      extra = root.querySelector("[data-recipe-extra]"),
      reason = root.querySelector("[data-recipe-reason]");
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-recipe-tab]").forEach((button) =>
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const index = Number(button.getAttribute("data-recipe-tab"));
        const path = recipePaths[index];
        if (!path) return;
        root
          .querySelectorAll("[data-recipe-tab]")
          .forEach((tab) => tab.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(tab === button)));
        if (name) name.textContent = path.name;
        if (models) models.textContent = path.models;
        if (extra) extra.textContent = path.extra;
        if (reason) reason.textContent = path.reason;
      }),
    );
  };
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initialize);
  initialize();
</script>

<style>
  .recipe-comparison {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .recipe-comparison figcaption {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .recipe-comparison figcaption > span {
    width: max-content;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
    font: 700 0.7rem/1 var(--font-mono);
  }
  .recipe-comparison h3,
  .recipe-comparison p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .recipe-comparison h3 {
    max-width: 26ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .recipe-comparison figcaption p,
  .recipe-comparison__reading {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }
  .recipe-comparison__switch {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .recipe-comparison__switch button {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    font: 700 0.75rem/1 var(--font-mono);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__switch button[aria-selected="true"] {
    border-color: var(--colour-primary);
    background: var(--colour-primary);
    color: var(--colour-primary-contrast);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__path {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    background: var(--colour-surface);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__models {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__models strong {
    font: 750 clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.8rem)/1 var(--font-display);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__models span,
  .recipe-comparison__path > p {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .recipe-comparison ol {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .recipe-comparison li {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .recipe-comparison li.is-extra {
    border-color: var(--colour-accent);
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
  }
  .recipe-comparison__reading {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .recipe-comparison figcaption {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .recipe-comparison__switch {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .recipe-comparison__switch button {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
